## Purpose

Stores metadata, AI analysis, quality assessment, fraud detection, and processing information for every image submitted by an applicant.

Each uploaded image (headshot, full body, profile, etc.) has its own record, allowing independent analysis, quality control, and fraud detection without modifying the original applicant record.

---

## Table Relationships

| Relationship | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `intake_id` → `intake.intake_id` | Image belongs to an applicant. |
| `batch_id` | Groups multiple images processed in the same AI pipeline run. |
| One applicant | Can have many media records. |

---

# Columns

## Identity

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `id` | Unique media record identifier (UUID). |
| `intake_id` | Applicant this image belongs to. |
| `batch_id` | Processing batch identifier shared across related images. |

---

## Image Storage

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `storage_url` | Original storage location of the uploaded image. |
| `r2_object_key` | Object key used within Cloudflare R2 storage. |
| `retool_signed_url` | Temporary signed URL generated for Retool or internal dashboards. |
| `retool_url_expires_at` | Expiration timestamp for the signed URL. |
| `is_thumbnail` | Indicates whether this record represents a thumbnail image. |

---

## Image Classification

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `photo_type` | Type of image submitted for analysis. |

Allowed values:

| Value | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `headshot` | Front-facing portrait. |
| `full_body` | Full-body image. |
| `profile` | Side profile photograph. |
| `three_quarter` | Three-quarter pose. |
| `polaroid` | Natural digitals/polaroids. |

---

## Image Metadata

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `image_resolution` | Resolution of the uploaded image (e.g. 3024×4032). |
| `image_file_size_kb` | File size in kilobytes. |
| `head_count_detected` | Number of faces detected in the image. |

---

## AI Photo Quality Assessment

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `lighting_quality` | AI assessment of lighting conditions. |
| `gemini_score` | Overall image quality score assigned by Gemini. |
| `gemini_notes` | AI-generated explanation of the quality assessment. |
| `photo_instruction_pass` | Whether the image meets submission guidelines. |
| `photo_instruction_fail_reason` | Explanation of why the image failed quality requirements. |
| `photo_compliance_checked` | Indicates whether compliance validation has been completed. |

---

## Fraud Detection

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `fraud_risk` | Overall fraud assessment. |
| `fraud_flags` | List of detected fraud indicators. |
| `ela_heatmap_url` | Link to the Error Level Analysis (ELA) visualization used for image tampering detection. |
| `facial_landmark_map_url` | Visualization of detected facial landmarks used during structural analysis. |

Allowed values for `fraud_risk`:

| Value | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `Clear` | No suspicious indicators detected. |
| `Suspicious` | Potential manipulation or anomalies detected. |
| `Manipulated` | Strong evidence of editing or synthetic content. |

---

## AI Processing

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `processing_status` | Current processing state within the AI pipeline. |
| `retry_count` | Number of processing retries performed. |
| `error_notes` | Processing or validation errors encountered. |

---

## Audit

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `created_at` | Timestamp when the media record was created. |

