# Typical Workflow

```
Applicant uploads photos
        │
        ▼
Media records created
        │
        ▼
Metadata extracted
        │
        ▼
AI quality assessment
        │
        ▼
Fraud detection
        │
        ▼
Compliance validation
        │
        ▼
Results available to reviewers
```

---

# Common Use Cases

- Validate uploaded images before AI scoring.
- Detect low-quality or non-compliant submissions.
- Identify potentially manipulated or AI-generated images.
- Generate signed URLs for secure internal review.
- Store image metadata separately from applicant records.
- Support batch processing of multiple images per applican